sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C   as Cliente
    participant G   as AuthGuard + RolesGuard
    participant PSC as PurchaseSuggestionController
    participant PSS as PurchaseSuggestionService
    participant DB  as PrismaService

    Note over C,DB: Ver diagrama 02 para el flujo detallado de autenticación y autorización

    C->>G: GET /purchase-suggestion<br>?pagina=1&limite=10&codigoMaterial=...&estado=...&centroAbastecedor=...&orden=desc&ordenarPor=fechaCreacion
    G-->>PSC: request autorizado

    PSC->>PSS: getSuggestions(filterDto)

    PSS->>PSS: Construir cláusula where:<br>- codigoMaterial (si se provee)<br>- estado (si se provee)<br>- centroAbastecedor (si se provee)

    PSS->>PSS: Construir orderBy:<br>{ [ordenarPor]: orden }

    par Consultas en paralelo
        PSS->>DB: purchaseSuggestion.count({ where })
        and
        PSS->>DB: purchaseSuggestion.findMany({\n  where, orderBy,\n  skip: (pagina-1)*limite,\n  take: limite,\n  select: COMMON_FIELDS + estadoCompraSugerida\n})
    end

    DB-->>PSS: total: number
    DB-->>PSS: PurchaseSuggestion[] (con estadoCompraSugerida)

    PSS->>PSS: Calcular ultimaPagina = Math.ceil(total / limite)

    PSS-->>PSC: { meta: { total, pagina, ultimaPagina }, data: PurchaseSuggestion[] }
    PSC-->>C: 200 { statusCode, message, data, meta }
